    "example.message-bar.note-alert": "An alert cuts in. Turn it on where a reader has to act before carrying on, and leave it off everywhere else.",
    "example.message-bar.note-dismiss": "The control ships hidden and `dist/message-bar.js` reveals it, so a page with no script carries no button that closes nothing.",
