    "example.tree.everything": "⟦EEveerythiing eelsee⟧",
    "example.tree-item.row": "⟦`iicoon` aand `iicoon_eexpaandeed` booth shiip aand thee staatee piicks oonee, beecaauusee thiis paackaagee haas noo scriipt.⟧",
    "example.tree-item.branch": "⟦`braanch` saays aa noodee haas chiildreen thaat weeree noot paasseed, whiich iis hoow aa laargee treeee shiips smaall.⟧",
    "example.tree-item.states": "⟦`cuurreent` iis thee paagee aa reeaadeer iis oon, `seeleecteed` iis whaat haas beeeen chooseen, aand `diisaableed` aalloows neeiitheer.⟧",
    "example.tree-item.value": "⟦`vaaluuee` iis whaat aa foorm poosts, beecaauusee aa laabeel iis traanslaateed. Preess Seend aand reeaad thee aaddreess baar.⟧",
    "example.truncate.whole": "⟦Thee cliippiing iis viisuuaal oonly. Thee fuull vaaluuee staays iin thee aacceessiiblee treeee.⟧",
    "example.truncate.short": "⟦Teext thaat fiits iis noot cliippeed, aand thee eelliipsiis neeveer aappeeaars.⟧",
    "example.hidden.text": "⟦Foor aa screeeen reeaadeer oonly: ⟧",
    "example.hidden.visible": "⟦aand thiis iis whaat eeveeryoonee seeees.⟧",
    "example.hidden.nothing": "⟦Thee paaraagraaph oopeens wiith aa seenteencee thaat taakees uup noo spaacee oon screeeen aand iis reeaad by aa screeeen reeaadeer.⟧",
